idth=\"72\" data-file-height=\"100\" /> <span style=\"color: #a55550;\">[敌方]</span>进入战斗时，每存在1个效应影响，自身获得1层<span class=\"tooltips color-sk\">[<span style=\"text-decoration:underline;\">历战之躯Ⅰ</span>]<span class=\"tooltips-content\" style=\"text-align:left;\"><span class=\"buff-label\">状态增益</span> 最大生命<span class=\"color-value\">+10%</span>，最终增伤<span class=\"color-value\">+3%</span>（可以叠加，不可驱散）</span></span><br /></div></div><div class=\"battle-info\"><div class=\"battle-info-title\">雨痕效应<span class=\"battle-info-subtitle\">CHALLENGE</span></div><div class=\"battle-info-tip\">固有影响</div><div class=\"battle-info-rule\"><img alt=\"V2a5 challenge rule1.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/58/V2a5_challenge_rule1.png/20px-V2a5_challenge_rule1.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/58/V2a5_challenge_rule1.png/30px-V2a5_challenge_rule1.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/58/V2a5_challenge_rule1.png/40px-V2a5_challenge_rule1.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"44\" data-file-height=\"44\" /> <span class=\"color-sk\">[我方]</span>回合开始时，获得1张<span class=\"tooltips color-sk\">[<span style=\"text-decoration:underline;\">暂歇</span>]<span class=\"tooltips-content\" style=\"text-align:left;\">目标获得<span class=\"tooltips color-sk\">[<span style=\"text-decoration:underline;\">噩梦</span>]<span class=\"tooltips-content\" style=\"text-align:left;\"><span class=\"buff-label\">控制</span> 无法行动，受到任意攻击后解除</span></span>，并获得<span class=\"color-value\">1</span>层<span class=\"tooltips color-sk\">[<span style=\"text-decoration:underline;\">爆发力</span>]<span class=\"tooltips-content\" style=\"text-align:left;\"><span class=\"buff-label\">状态增益</span> 攻击时，创伤加成<span class=\"color-value\">+25%</span>(生效后减少<span class=\"color-value\">1</span>层）</span></span>，本咒语需消耗<span class=\"color-value\">1</span>行动点；行动结束仍处于手牌时，删除右侧其他咒语</span></span>；出牌结束时，删除<span class=\"tooltips color-sk\">[<span style=\"text-decoration:underline;\">暂歇</span>]<span class=\"tooltips-content\" style=\"text-align:left;\">目标获得<span class=\"tooltips color-sk\">[<span style=\"text-decoration:underline;\">噩梦</span>]<span class=\"tooltips-content\" style=\"text-align:left;\"><span class=\"buff-label\">控制</span> 无法行动，受到任意攻击后解除</span></span>，并获得<span class=\"color-value\">1</span>层<span class=\"tooltips color-sk\">[<span style=\"text-decoration:underline;\">爆发力</span>]<span class=\"tooltips-content\" style=\"text-align:left;\"><span class=\"buff-label\">状态增益</span> 攻击时，创伤加成<span class=\"color-value\">+25%</span>(生效后减少<span class=\"color-value\">1</span>层）</span></span>，本咒语需消耗<span class=\"color-value\">1</span>行动点；行动结束仍处于手牌时，删除右侧其他咒语</span></span>右侧的所有咒语</div><div class=\"battle-info-rule\"><img alt=\"V2a5 challenge rule1.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/58/V2a5_challenge_rule1.png/20px-V2a5_challenge_rule1.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/58/V2a5_challenge_rule1.png/30px-V2a5_challenge_rule1.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/58/V2a5_challenge_rule1.png/40px-V2a5_challenge_rule1.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"44\" data-file-height=\"44\" /> <span class=\"color-sk\">[我方]</span>咒语盒重新生成时，1/2号位的友方陷入3回合<span class=\"tooltips color-sk\">[<span style=\"text-decoration:underline;\">心神不宁</span>]<span class=\"tooltips-content\" style=\"text-align:left;\"><span class=\"buff-label\">状态异常</span> 无法提升激情</span></span>，3/4号位的友方失去<span class=\"color-value\">50%</span>最大生命</div></div><div class=\"battle-info\"><div class=\"battle-info-title\">奖励<span class=\"battle-info-subtitle\">REWARD</span></div><div class=\"battle-info-empty\"><div><img alt=\"无奖励\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c9/Bg_kong.png/200px-Bg_kong.png\" decoding=\"async\"